^ Hardware Bridge           | Xilinx Spartan XC3S100E  |
^ Wireless No1              | //distinct Chip//: Qualcomm-QCA9558-AT4A w/ 3x3 MIMO for 2.4GHz 802.11b/g/n  |
^ Wireless No1 RAM size     | 128 MiB |
^ Wireless No1 RAM Chip     | Winbond W9751G6KB-25 |
^ Wireless No2              | //distinct Chip//: Qualcomm-QCA9880 AR1A w/ 3x3 MIMO for 2.4/5GHz 802.11a/b/g/n/ac  |
^ Wireless antenna          | 5x PCB, 1x Airgain N5X20SC (U.FL)  |
^ [[docs:techref:hardware:switch]]   | 4x Gigabit Atheros 8035  |
^ [[docs:techref:hardware:internet.access.technologies|Modem]]   | xDSL  |
^ Modem Chip                | Lantiq XWAY v1.1 PSB 80190  |
^ USB                       | //distinct Chip//: Renesas-µPD720202 w/ on the PCIe bus  2x USB 3.0 |
^ DECT                      | YES  |
^ [[docs:techref:hardware:port.serial|Serial]]  | internal:GND/TXD/RXD/3.3V:115200 N 8 R  |
