==== Opening the case ====
**Note:** This will void your warranty!

Four screws on the corners on bottom. Once screws removed, there is a small clip at the front that needs some gentle assistance. 

** Case Bottom ** {{ media:avm:fritzbox_7490:fritzbox_7490_case_bottom_withlables.jpg?direct&500 |Case Bottom}}


** Main PCB ** {{ media:avm:fritzbox_7490:fritzbox_7490_pcb_top_serialpinout.jpg?direct&500 |PCB with serial Pinout}}

==== Serial ====
-> [[docs:techref:hardware:port.serial]] general information about the serial port, serial port cable, etc.

The serial ports are located near the processing unit (with the heat sink on top): the serial port is the second row from left.

The PCB has 3 columns of pin headers, columns from left to right and rows from top to bottom: (when looking at the board with the DSL port on the top right). 

                   serial port of Lantiq xRX200 soc.
                  /   Serial port of Qualcomm Atheros QCA9558 soc. for WASP 
                 |   /
      column:  1 2   3
  row:  
   1-GND->     O O   O
   2-TX->      O O   O
   3-RX->      O O   O
   4-3.3V->    O O   O


^ Serial connection parameters: 115200n8r (<baud><parity><bits><flow>) |
^ Example using pyserial:\\ pyserial-miniterm /dev/ttyUSB0 115200 --raw --eol CR |

More PCB photos
[[https://www.mikrocontroller.net/attachment/278606/P1000439s.jpg|photo taken from mikrocontroller.net]]

