===== Bootloader =====
Uses [[docs:techref:bootloader:eva|EVA]]. 

Refer to EVA's tech reference for environment dump and commands its minimal shell supports:
[[docs:techref:bootloader:eva#fritzbox_7490_running_fritzos_v683|eva-7490-techref]]

